+## Overview
+
+Across 30 orders, total revenue reached $7,154.44. The median order value was $204.94, showing wide spread between small consumable sales and high-value item purchases.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget led all products at $2,392.00 in revenue, driven by its $149.50 unit price despite low unit counts. Widget followed closely at $2,118.94 on high volume. Doohickey contributed $1,513.00 and Sprocket trailed at $1,130.50, reflecting its low $4.75 price.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North was the strongest region at $2,176.35, ahead of East at $1,830.79 and South at $1,732.48. West lagged at $1,414.82, roughly 35% below North. The gap suggests uneven demand or coverage rather than a single dominant market.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Prioritize Gadget stock and promotion, since it earns the most revenue per order and tops total sales at $2,392.00.
+- Investigate West's $1,414.82 result and lift it toward North's $2,176.35 through targeted regional outreach.
+- Reprice or bundle low-margin Sprocket, whose $4.75 price yields only $1,130.50 despite high unit volume.
